<title>JAPAN: MOF says to hold 3-month T-bill auction on Tuesday.</title>
<headline>MOF says to hold 3-month T-bill auction on Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finance Ministry is planning to offer three-month Treasury bills (T-bills) through a price competitive auction on Tuesday, a ministry official said on Monday.</p>
<p>The new issue will roll over 1.3 trillion yen worth of the 169th three-month T-bills due to mature on June 20, market sources said.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-5473-3748</p>
</text>
